  "status": "active",
  "experimental": true,
  "publisher": "Vernum Projecten B.V. (FerroBRIDGE)",
  "description": "Overrides ConceptMap/datatype-ce-to-codeableconcept of hl7.fhir.uv.v2mappings 1.0.0. The guide gates its CE.1 row into coding[1].code on the Narrative-Condition \"If mapped to FHIR, use Code System and Display\", which no machine evaluates, so no Coding the map writes gets a code and every Coding it writes lacks the element that makes it a concept. This supplement runs that row with no condition, so CE.1 is the code beside the display (CE.2) and the system (CE.3) the guide already writes; every other row is the guide's. Recorded as an upstream defect on FerroBRIDGE #332.",
